__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.claude/intake/state.json
.claude/intake/heartbeat.json
.claude/intake/worklog.lock
.claude/intake/.worklog.json.*.tmp

# The librarian index is derived and disposable: rebuilt from
# .claude/librarians/*/*.jsonl on demand. Never commit it - a binary SQLite file
# cannot be merged, so two people indexing different commits would conflict
# irreconcilably. The append-only .jsonl next to it is the record; whether THAT
# is committed is a per-project choice.
.claude/librarians/index.db
.claude/librarians/index.db-wal
.claude/librarians/index.db-shm
.claude/librarians/*/*.lock
.claude/librarians/*/.*.tmp
